      "content": "REST API for Pylon (usepylon.com), the B2B customer support and customer operations platform. Programmatically manage issues (tickets), accounts, contacts, users, teams, tags, custom fields, the knowledge base, and tasks/projects. Authentication uses a Bearer API token; only Admin users can create API tokens in Pylon settings.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Pylon Support",
